WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:05.000
CoverageCV preserves annotation coverage when detection datasets are merged.

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
This illustration withholds person labels. An ordinary loss can penalize correct person predictions.

00:12.000 --> 00:19.000
CoverageCV keeps supplied labels, but suppresses negative supervision for an unreviewed class.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.000
Switch sources: the same rule protects helmets when only people were annotated.

00:25.000 --> 00:34.000
On chess pawns: 78.82 AP50:95 versus 76.25 for ordinary training. Three matched seeds; 58 validation images.

00:34.000 --> 00:40.000
Recorded predictions use actual checkpoints. The reference has complete labels; it is not a frontier model.

00:40.000 --> 00:46.000
Inspect additional validation images. Benchmark scores use the full validation set.
